"ACID BLAST"

Usage : cast 'acid blast'
Group : Malediction
Mana  : 400 - 500

With this spell, the caster shoots forth a spray of deadly, flesh-dissolving
acid from the fingertips of both hands. The spray is directed toward all non-
group-member occupants in the room.
#
"ADRENALINE BOOST"

Usage       : will 'adrenaline boost' 

With this mind-skill, the psionic increases his body's adrenaline production,
effectively making himself several degrees stronger.
#
ANIMATE "ANIMATE DEAD"

Usage : cast 'animate dead' <corpse>
Group : Necromancy
Mana  : 80 - 100

With a powerful prayer (or unholy curse!), the caster may seek to infuse life
into the dead. The resulting undead zombie will obey the caster and follow
loyally until destroyed.
#
ASTRAL

The spells of this group represent the ability to control the realm of the
astral plane. They include:

Level 1: Recall
Level 2: Gate
Level 3: Group Recall
Level 4: Dream Travel

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as 
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).
 
See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
BLESS

Usage    : cast 'bless' <victim | object>
Duration : 2 Hours, permanent for objects.
Group    : Protection
Mana     : 40 - 50

Bless on a victim will improve the victim's saving throw versus spells
and hitroll. The amount will vary depending on the caster's level.

It is only possible to bless non-magic items, and the object blessed may 
weigh no more than the level of caster. 

A blessed weapon gains a hitroll modifier. Other blessed objects are not yet
defined.
#
BLINDNESS

Usage    : cast 'blindness' <victim>
Duration : 2 Hours
Group    : Malediction
Mana     : 200 - 300

Blindness will blind a victim failing its saving throw. A blinded person will
will have a penalty to both hitroll and AC.

See Also: HITROLL AC
#
"BURNING HANDS"

Usage : cast 'burning hands' <victim>
Group : Malediction
Mana  : 40 - 70

Engulfs the caster's hands with flames that you can then use to grab your enemy
and subsequently burn them.
#
"CALL LIGHTNING"

Usage : cast 'call lightning' <victim>
Group : Environmental
Mana  : 40 - 70

This spell will use the "force of nature" to make lightning strike the victim.
It is therefore only possible to call lightning outside, and it has to be
raining (or worse).

See Also: "CONTROL WEATHER" WEATHER
#
CAST

Usage: cast '<spell name>' [target]

For magickal people.  If you want to throw a spell at someone or something.
You must be wielding a wand in order to cast your spell.

Example:

  > cast 'burning hands' <player>
  Note that the name of the spell must be enclosed by "'"s.

Examples:

  > help cure ligh
  > help ventri
  > help energy drain

Refer to the individual spell help files for further information on a
particular spell.
#
"CELL ADJUSTMENT"

Usage       : will 'cell adjustment' <self>

The psionic focuses his mental abilities on his own healing processes,
Causing his wounds to mend much faster than normal.
#
CHAMELEON

Usage      : will 'chameleon' <self>

The psionic change his colors to match the surroundings, effectively
Becoming hidden in a room.  If successful, you can only be "sensed" 
by the "sense life" spell.  Even if sensed your identity will remain 
hidden. This is a rather taxing mental feat, and can only be attempted
once per day.  You may be able to perform actions and still remain hidden,
but the chances of this are slight.

#
"CHANGE DENSITY"

Usage       : will 'change density' <self>

The psionic changes the physical make-up of his body, assuming the
ability  to walk, lie down, etc, on liquid surfaces.
#
"CHARM PERSON"

Usage       : cast 'charm person' <victim>

It is not possible to charm anyone that is already charmed, if
you're charmed yourself, or if the person is higher level than
yourself.  The person will get a saving throw versus "paralysis".

A charmed person will follow you, and not be able to attack you. You
can order the charmed person using the order command. Monsters don't
like being charmed, and a failed attempt will usually result in your
being attacked.

See Also: FOLLOW ORDER
#
"CHILL TOUCH"

Usage       : cast 'chill touch' <victim>
Duration    : Instantaneous
Save        : Versus spell for half damage.

This spell is more powerful than the flame arrow spell.
A victim failing its saving throw will get its strength
reduced by one.

See Also: "FLAME ARROW"
#
CLONE

Usage : cast 'clone'
Group : Necromancy
Mana  : 100 - 150

By using this powerful ability, the mentalist may create a clone of him or
herself. This clone is not perfect, however, and will not stand up to close
scrutiny - it is also very aggressive and will attack most creatures (be they
friend or foe) on sight. It is however, useful for evading pursuers and fooling
the enemy.
#
COLORSPRAY "COLOR SPRAY"

Usage : cast 'color spray' <victim>
Group : Malediction
Mana  : 100 - 150

Send a colorful but deadly spray at your victim.
For help on actual color, see: ANSI
#
"CONJURE ELEMENTAL" CONJURE ELEMENTAL

Usage    : cast 'conjure elemental'
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Necromancy
Mana     : 500 - 700

By means of this powerful conjuration spell, the caster can summon elementals
from their planes of existence to aid him or her in battle or other tasks.
In order to summon an elemental, the caster first needs to have the correct 
reagents for the elemental type that he or she wishes to summon.  Information
on elemental reagents can be found in books on arcane spellcraft, or consult
your local sage.
#
"CONTROL WEATHER"

Usage : cast 'control weather' <'better' | 'worse'>
Group : Environmental
Mana  : 200 - 300

This spell will change the "course" of the current weather. It is useful if
you want to alter the weather so you can cast another spell, call lightning
for example.

Obviously, you must be outside to cast this spell.

Example:
  > cast 'control weather' worse
#
"CREATE FOOD"

Usage : cast 'create food'
Group : Utility
Mana  : 40 - 50

This spell instantly creates a fresh mushroom, capable of keeping you full
for 10 hours.

See Also: "CREATE WATER"
#
"CREATE WATER"

Usage : cast 'create water' <drink container>
Group : Utility
Mana  : 40 - 50

Expect disastrous results if cast upon a drink container which contains
another liquid than water.  Empty or water containers will be filled.

See Also: "CREATE FOOD"
#
"CURE BLIND"

Usage : cast 'cure blind' <victim>
Group : Rejuvenation
Mana  : 40 - 50
  
This spell will cure a person blinded by the "blindness" spell, it
can not remove blindness caused by, for example, cursed items.
#
"CURE CRITIC"

Usage       : cast 'cure critic' <victim>
Duration    : Instantaneous

This spell cures many hitpoints of damage.

#
"CURE LIGHT"

Usage : cast 'cure light' <victim>
Group : Rejuventation
Mana  : 40 - 50

Cures minor wounds and scratches.
#
CURSE

Usage    : cast 'curse' <victim | object>
Duration : Varies with caster's level, or permanent on objects.
Group    : Malediction
Mana     : 40 - 70

Curse cast on a person that fails the saving throw, will reduce their
hitroll and damage roll significantly.  It will also reduce the saving
throw versus paralysis by one. At higher levels, it is possible that
a curse might cause the victim to have an unfortunate accident of the
lethal type.

When cast upon an object, the object will become undropable.
#
DETECTION

The spells of this group represent the ability to see beyond the natural
world. They include:

Level 1: Detect Alignment, Detect Magic, Infravision
Level 2: Detect Invisibility, Sense Life, Detect Race
Level 3: Detect Poison
Level 4: Mindsight

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as 
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).
 
See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
"DETECT ALIGNMENT"

Usage    : cast 'detect alignment' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Detection
Mana     : 20 - 40

Allows the caster to detect the alignment of those around them.
Evil will show as a red aura, good in a blue aura.

See Also: "DETECT INVISIBILITY"
#
"DETECT INVISIBILITY"

Usage    : cast 'detect invisibility' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Detection
Mana     : 100 - 150

This spell enables you to see invisible items and players.
#
"DETECT MAGIC"

Usage    : cast 'detect magic' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Detection
Mana     : 20 - 40

This spell will let you see the magical aura surrounding magical objects.
#
"DETECT POISON"

Usage : cast 'detect poison' <victim | food | drink>
Group : Detection
Mana  : 200 - 300

Cast on food or drinks (drink containers) you will be able to sense if it is
poisoned. Cast on a person you will be able to see if that person is
poisoned.
#
"DETECT RACE"

Usage    : cast 'detect race' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Detection
Mana     : 80 - 100

Not all races are easy to detect with the eye, so this spell will let you
see the victim's race.
#
DISINTEGRATION DISINTEGRATE

Usage : cast 'disintegration' <victim>
Group : Malediction
Mana  : 500 - 700

This powerful spell calls forth a beam of raw energy that can be directed by the
caster. Bewhere though, this energy is very unstable and can have devastating
results if not used carefully!
#
"DISPEL EVIL"

Usage : cast 'dispel evil' <victim>
Group : Necromancy
Mana  : 40 - 70

This spell will only affect evil creatures.  An evil person of level equal or less
than caster will suffer much damage. While an evil person of higher level will
suffer slightly less damage.

See Also: "DISPEL GOOD"
#
"DISPEL GOOD"

Usage : cast 'dispel good' <victim>
Group : Necromancy
Mana  : 40 - 70

This spell will only affect good creatures.  A good person of level equal or less
than caster will suffer much damage. While a good person of higher level will
suffer slightly less damage.

See Also: "DISPEL EVIL"
#
"DIVINE INTERVENTION" DIVINE INTERVENTION

Usage    : cast 'divine intervention'
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Necromancy
Mana     : 500 - 700

The most powerful prayer someone can make, divine intervention will summon
warrior angels from the caster's Gods to serve them for a short period of time.
Should the caster be pure evil or good, the prayer will be answered two-fold.
#
DOMINATE

Usage : cast 'dominate' <victim>
Group : Necromancy
Mana  : 100 - 150

The caster forces his mental energies on the victim, over-coming any free
thinking and assuming the ability to order the victim to do most anything.

See Also: FOLLOW ORDER "MASS DOMINATE"
#
"DREAM TRAVEL"

Usage    : cast 'dream travel'
Duration : 5 Hours
Group    : Astral
Mana     : 400 - 500

By the means of this power, the caster can make his or her body travel thousands
of miles while they sleep. The caster merely begins the incantation and then
goes to sleep. Then he/she has a dream about the place they are going to, and
when they awake, they find that they have arrived! A very efficient means of
transportation.
#
EARTHQUAKE

Usage : cast 'earthquake'
Group : Environmental
Mana  : 350 - 400

The spell causes an earthquake to occur in a small radius surrounding the
caster. The earthquake will damage everyone in the room, save the caster and
his or her friends.
#
"ENCHANT WEAPON"

Usage    : cast 'enchant weapon' <weapon>
Duration : Permanent
Group    : Utility
Mana     : 500 - 700

This spell will enchant non-magical (non-modifying) weapons only. By non-modifying
weapons we refer to weapons that might alter any ability such as, for example, damage.
The only way to know if a weapon is suitable for enchantment is to fully identify it.

The amount of enchantment will vary depending on the caster's level.
Enchanted weapons become unusable by people of the caster's opposite
alignment. (ie. If the caster is good, only good people can subsequently
use the weapon)
#
"ENCHANT ARMOR"

Usage    : cast 'enchant armor' <armor>
Duration : Permanent
Group    : Utility
Mana     : 500 - 700

This spell will enchant non-magical (non-modifying) armor only. By non-modifying
armor we refer to armor that might alter any ability such as, for example, damage.
The only way to know if a piece of armor is suitable for enchantment is to fully
identify it.

The enchantment is based on the caster's level. Enchanted armor becomes unusable
by people of the caster's opposite alignment. (ie. If the caster is good, only good
people can subsequently use the armor)
#
"ENERGY DRAIN"

Usage : cast 'energy drain' <victim>

This spell sucks the life force from the victim, causing a tremendous amount
damage.
#
ENTRAP ENTRAPMENT

Usage    : cast 'entrapment' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level 
Group    : Malediction
Mana     : 100 - 150

This spell sends forth a series of binding strands, similar to that of a
spider's web, which will ensnare the victim and prevent them from functioning
during a battle.

Due to the complicated nature of this spell, if you are observed casting it
on a victim, they will be able to strike at you once before the incantation is
complete.
#
ENVIRONMENTAL

The spells of this group represent the ability to effect the caster's
surrounding environment. They include:

Level 1: Call Lightning, Invisibility, Waterwalk, Waterbreathe
Level 2: Fly, Haste, Slow
Level 3: Control Weather, Group Invisibility, Earthquake
Level 4: Meteor Swarm, Hellfire, Flamestrike, Smokescreen

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as 
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).
 
See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
"FLESH OF STONE"
Usage      : will 'flesh of stone'

The psionic's mental concentration changes his physical make-up, hardening the
surface layer of skin to the density of stone, protecting the psionic from many
light blows, and softening harder strikes.
#
"FIELD CRAFT"

The skills of this group represent the ability for the character to be
self-sufficient when away from the confines of a city. They include:

Level 1: Scrounge, Scout, Track, Alchemy, Skin
Level 2: Detect, First Aid, Refuge
Level 3: Rescue, Ambush
Level 4: Evasion, Scribe
#
FIREBALL

Usage : cast 'fireball' <victim>
Group : Malediction
Mana  : 200 - 250

With a word of command, the caster shoots forth a ball of fire from his palm,
incinerating the victim and dealing massive damage.

See Also: "COLOR SPRAY"
#
"FLAME STRIKE" FLAME STRIKE FLAMESTRIKE

Usage    : cast 'flame strike' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Environmental
Mana     : 500 - 700

Causes a bolt of fire from the heavens to come down and strike the victim.
Will usually cause the victim to be set on fire and burn considerably. 
Can only be used outdoors, of course. Fun for the whole family!
#
FLY

Usage    : cast 'fly' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Environmental
Mana     : 150 - 200

Look ma, I'm flying! Useful for getting around in places you can't walk, like
over water, deep chasms, sky castles, etc.
#
GATE

Usage : cast 'gate'
Group : Astral
Mana  : 150 - 200

This spell, when cast in the secluded groves and magickal centers of energy
where moongates normally appear, causes a portal to appear, regardless of
the date or time. 

This portal functions similar to other moongates; taking you to the farthest
reaches of the cosmos where the moongates intersect in their
faster-than-light paths of travel.

Casting this spell in a room where a gate already exists can have strange,
far-reaching side-affects. Few have returned to tell what those side-affects 
actually are.

See Also: MOONGATE
#
"HAND TO HAND"

The skills of this group represent the ability to fight without the use of a
weapon. They include:

Level 1: Kick, Bash, Headbutt
Level 2: Bearhug, Trip, Slug
Level 3: Smackheads
Level 4: Neckbreak, Groinrip, Sleeper
#
HARM

Usage : cast 'harm' <victim>
Group : Malediction
Mana  : 300 - 400

Using this spell, a caster can inflict grievous harm upon his or her enemies. 
#
HASTE

Usage    : cast 'haste' <self>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Environmental
Mana     : 150 - 200

By use of this power, the caster can speed up his or her actions in movement
as well as in combat.

See Also: SLOW
#
HEAL

Usage : cast 'heal' <victim>
Group : Rejuvenation
Mana  : 150 - 200

Heal will restore anywhere from 200 to 300 hitpoints for the victim. A
victim who is blinded will also be cured by the heal spell.

See Also: "CURE BLINDNESS"
#
HELLFIRE

Usage : cast 'hellfire'
Group : Environmental
Mana  : 500 - 700

Summon the flames of hell to scorch thy enemies. Let the pretenders drown in
the fiery grave you create for them.
#
"HOLY WARD" WARD

Usage	    : cast 'holy ward' <target>
Duration    : Varies

The holy ward grants magickal protection to the target against things that
would normally damage him or her. 

#
"HOLY SHIELD"

Usage	   : cast 'holy shield'
Duration : 2 Hours

Creates a magickal barrier around your entire party. The protection afforded
by the barrier is dependant upon the level of the caster.
#
INFRAVISION

Usage    : cast 'infravision'
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Infravision
Mana     : 40 - 70

Allows the caster to detect the heat given off by objects giving them
the ability to have much better vision in dark conditions.

See Also: "DETECT INVISIBILITY"
#
INVIGORATE

Usage : cast 'invigorate' <victim>
Group : Rejuvenation
Mana  : 200 - 300

This spell alleviates the pains of traveling, leaving the victim refreshed
and ready to continue their journey.
#
INVISIBILITY

Usage    : cast 'invisibility' <victim | object>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Invisibility
Mana     : 80 - 100

Makes the target of the spell invisible to everyone except those who have
the "detect invisibility" spell.

See Also: "DETECT INVISIBILITY"
#
INVULNERABILITY INVULN GLOBE "GLOBE OF INVULNERABILITY"

Usage    : cast 'globe of invulnerability' <self>
Duration : 2 Hours
Group    : Protection
Mana     : 500 - 700

Drako's minor globe of invulnerability is an ancient spell, powerful and
efficient. It protects the victim from a variety of attacks, as well as 
increasing resistance to certain magickal offenses. The magnitude of the
protections is dependant upon the level of the caster.
#
LAY HANDS "LAY HANDS"

Usage: cast "lay hands" <self>

This prayer-spell brings a flow of healing through the Paladin's hands, 
restoring health to himself.

#
"LESSER PERCEPTION"
Conquering the realm of the unseen, the psionic can focus his mental
energies towards seeing the unseen.  This lesser version is great for 
seeing in the dark, as well as seeing other people's true nature.

See Also: "GREATER PERCEPTION"
#
"GREATER PERCEPTION"
Mastering the realm of the unseen, the psionic can focus his mental
Energies towards seeing the normally hidden creatures in a room and
invisible objects/creatures.

See Also: "LESSER PERCEPTION"
#
"GROUP HEAL"

Usage : cast 'group heal'
Group : Rejuventation
Mana  : 500 - 700

This powerful prayer heals the caster's entire group.

See Also: HEAL
#
"GROUP RECALL"

Usage : cast 'group recall'
Group : Astral
Mana  : 350 - 400

This spell will recall the caster's entire group to their respective
home towns, given they are not fighting and in the same room as the caster.

See Also: "WORD OF RECALL"
#
"GROUP INVISIBILITY" "GROUP INVIS"

Usage    : cast 'group invisibility'
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Environmental
Mana     : 300 - 400

This powerful magick allows the caster to conceal his or her entire party behind
a veil of invisibility.

See Also: INVISIBILITY VISIBLE
#
LEVITATE

Usage	: will 'levitate' <self>

Using the power of mind-over-matter, the psionic can levitate himself into
the air, hovering 2-3 feet above the ground (or water).
#
"LIGHTNING BOLT"

Usage       : cast 'lightning bolt' <victim>
Duration    : Instantaneous
Save        : Versus spell for half damage.

This spell is more powerful than the shocking grasp spell.

See Also: "SHOCKING GRASP"
#
"FLAME ARROW"

Usage       : cast 'FLAME ARROW' <victim>
Duration    : Instantaneous
Save        : Versus spell for half damage.

Causes a bolt of magical flame to be thrown from the casters hands at the
victim.
#
"MAGIC MISSILE" MISSILE

Usage : cast 'magic missile' <victim>
Group : Malediction
Mana  : 80 - 100

Creates a magical bolt of energy which is fired at the victim, similar to
an arrow.
#
MALEDICTION

The spells of this group represent harm that can be inflicted on others
both in, and out of battle. They include:

Level 1: Poison, Curse, Burning Hands
Level 2: Magic Missile, Color Spray, Entrapment
Level 3: Blindness, Harm, Fireball
Level 4: Energy Drain, Acid Blast, Ray of Disruption, Disintegration

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as 
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).
 
See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
"MENTAL LAPSE" MENTAL LAPSE

Usage : cast 'mental lapse' <victim>
Group : Psychic
Mana  : 400 - 500

Projecting a mental voice across virtually endless distance, the caster
can stop <victim> from hunting them. At the highest mastery level, the
caster can stop <victim> from hunting anyone.
#
METALSKIN "METAL SKIN"

Usage    : cast 'metalskin' <target>
Duration : 2 Hours
Group    : Protection
Mana     : 200 - 300

Causes the target's skin to turn metallic, protecting them from damage. The
amount of protection is dependant upon the level of the caster.
#
"METEOR SWARM" METEOR SWARM

Usage : cast 'meteor swarm'
Group : Environmental
Mana  : 500 - 700

By means of this powerful magick, the caster can call meteors from the heavens
down to smite all of his or her enemies in the room.  This can obviously only
work when the spell is cast outdoors.
#
"MASS HEAL"

Usage: cast 'mass heal' <target>

Twice as strong as the heal spell, this powerful healing will restore from
400 to 500 hitpoints.
#
"MASS DOMINATE"

Usage : cast 'mass dominate'
Group : Necromancy
Mana  : 300 - 400

An improved version of the dominate power that will assert your control
over everyone in the room that is not in your party.  Useful for redominating
part of your army that has strayed.
#
"MIND ATTACK" MINDATTACK

Usage : cast 'mind attack' <victim>
Group : Psychic
Mana  : 80 - 100

An attack on the mind of a victim is an appalling sight. The victim first
feels a mental invasion, which causes pressure that slowly increases to the
point of extreme, incredible pain. The victim's brain, revolting against the
attack, sometime succumbs to the pressure, exploding through the skull.
#
"MIND BAR" MINDBAR

Usage    : cast 'mind bar' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Psychic
Mana     : 500 - 700

By use of this power, you can place a mental bar across a vicitim's mind,
leaving them without access to his or her intellect. Successful barring leaves
the victim dumbfounded, unable to speak or perform many other tasks.

#
"MIND BLAST" MINDBLAST

Usage : cast 'mind blast' <victim>
Group : Psychic
Mana  : 100 - 150

A mental blast of pure energy erupts from the attacker, surging toward the
victim and hitting their mind like a physical blow.
#
"MIND POKE" MINDPOKE

Usage: cast 'mind poke' <victim>
Group : Psychic
Mana  : 40 - 70

A victim of this mind-spell receives a powerful jolt of energy in their mind,
causing level-based damage ranging from a mild head-ache to a physical hole.
#
"MIND SIGHT" MINDSIGHT

Usage : cast 'mindsight' <victim>
Group : Detection
Mana  : 400 - 700

Using mental telepathy, the caster "looks" through the eyes of the victim
and sees the world wherever the victim may be. If the victim is of a 
significantly higher level than the caster, the caster may not be able to
penetrate their mind. It is also noted that certain races and peoples have
natural shields against this type of mind probing. Others in the victim's room
(or the victim himself, if familiar with the spell) will be able to sense the sighting.
#
UTILITY

The skills and spells of this group represent various abilities that do not
fall into other categories, but are useful nonetheless. They include:

Level 1: Create Food, Create Water
Level 2: Sleep
Level 3: Word of Strength, Word of Intellect
Level 4: Enchant Weapon, Enchant Armor

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as 
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).
 
See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
NECROMANCY

The spells of this group represent the ability to effect life on a
molecular level. They include:

Level 1: Dispel Good, Dispel Evil, Animate Dead
Level 2: Clone, Dominate
Level 3: Mass Dominate, Syphon Energy
Level 4: Conjure Elemental, Divine Intervention

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as 
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).
 
See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
PARALYSIS PARALYSE

There are various magickal spells and toxins in the realm that are capable of
rendering their target immobile for a period of time. While the spell itself
won't kill, the target is unable to do anything and is completely vulnerable.
#
POISON

Usage    : cast 'poison' <victim | food | drink>
Duration : Varies with caster's level, or permanent on food and drinks.
Group    : Malediction
Mana     : 40 - 70

Casting poison on food or drink (containers) will poison it. Eating
poisoned food/drinks will poison the person eating or drinking.

A person who is poisoned will suffer damage every hour, lose strength, and
gain less points than usual.

See Also: "REMOVE POISON" "DETECT POISON"
#
PROTECTION

The spells of this group represent the ability to protect yourself and
others in preparation for battle. They include:

Level 1: Bless
Level 2: Protection From Evil, Protection From Good
Level 3: Sanctuary, Metal Skin
Level 4: Holy Shield, Invulnerability, Group Protection From Evil/Good

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).

See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
"PROTECTION FROM EVIL" "P F E" "PFE"

Usage    : cast 'protection from evil' <self>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Protection
Mana     : 100 - 150

Gives minor protection from the attacks of evil opponents, and wards off
some aggressive mobs. 

Note: Casting this spell upon yourself when you are evil can have
disasterous side effects.
#
"PROTECTION FROM GOOD" "P F G" "PFG"

Usage    : cast 'protection from good' <self>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Protection
Mana     : 100 - 150

Gives minor protection from the attacks of good opponents, and wards off
those pesky do-gooders who always wish you harm.

Note: Casting this spell upon yourself while you are good can have
disasterous side effects.
#
PSIBLAST

Usage		: will 'psiblast' <victim>
Duration	: Instantaneous
Save        : versus psychic for half damage

This incredibly powerful psionic attack is capable of devastating an opponent.
The psionic must be careful, however, for this power is difficult to control.
There is a chance that a psiblast might backfire on the psionic, causing
permanent brain damage to him or her.

#
"PSYCHIC SHIELD"

Usage: will 'psychic shield' self
Duration: Instananeous
Save: -

By means of this power, the psionic can shield himself from damage done by others
to him.  The psychic shield shields the psionic from normal, as well as magical and psychic
attacks.

#
PSYCHIC

The spells of this group represent the ability of the caster to effect the minds
of others. They include:

Level 1: Mind Poke, Mind Attack
Level 2: Mind Blast, Turn (skill)
Level 3: Flesh Alter (skill), Mind link (skill)
Level 4: Mental Lapse, Mind Bar, Soul Trap

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as 
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).
 
See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
"RAY OF DISRUPTION" RAY DISRUPTION

Usage : cast 'ray of disruption' <victim>
Group : Malediction
Mana  : 500 - 700

Karnek's Ray of Disruption is one of the most powerful spells known. It calls forth
a ray of pure energy that can burn through most anything. This spell can backfire,
the results usually being fatal.
#
REJUVENATION

The spells of this group represent the ability to heal both yourself and
others. They include:

Level 1: Cure Light, Remove Curse, Remove Poison, Sobriety
Level 2: Heal, Cure Blind
Level 3: Mass Heal, Invigorate
Level 4: Vitality, Group Heal

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage staves, as 
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).
 
See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
"REMOVE CURSE"

Usage : cast 'remove curse' <victim | object>
Group : Rejuvenation
Mana  : 40 - 60

Will remove a curse on carried objects or any persons in the room.
#
"REMOVE POISON"

Usage : cast 'remove poison' <victim | food | drink> 
Group : Rejuvenation
Mana  : 40 - 60

Will remove the affects of poison from a victim or an object.

See Also: POISON
#
SANCTUARY

Usage    : cast 'sanctuary' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Protection
Mana     : 200 - 300

When protected by sanctuary <victim> will only receive 1/2 the normal
damage caused by a particular blow. The default victim is the caster.

See Also: "HOLY SHIELD" BLESS
#
"SHOCKING GRASP"

Usage       : cast 'shocking grasp' <victim>
Duration    : Instantaneous
Save        : Versus spell for half damage.

This spell is more powerful than the burning hands spell.

See Also: "BURNING HANDS"
#
"SENSE LIFE"

Usage    : cast 'sense life'
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Detection
Mana     : 100 - 150

Allows the caster to sense the presence of a player or monster in the
room which is hiding.  The true identity will remain hidden however.
Invisible persons are also considered hidden.

See Also: HIDE

#
"SHIFT REALITY" SHIFT REALITY
Usage		: will 'shift reality'
Duration	: Instantaneous
Save		: Versus psychic to prevent

By use of this mental power, the psionic or mystic can shift their location
in the material world to somewhere else.  Like all forms of psychic transfer,
the mentalist has no control over where he or she ends up, making this power
somewhat hazardous.

#
SLOW

Usage    : cast 'slow' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Environmental
Mana     : 150 - 200

Sends the forces of time against the victim, causing him or her to slow down
in relation to other PC's and NPC's in the game. Primarily, this affects
combat and skill use.

See Also: HASTE
#
SMOKESCREEN SMOKE

Usage    : cast 'smokescreen'
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Environmental
Mana     : 400 - 500

This spell creates a blinding cloud of acrid smoke that affects everyone
in the room except the caster.

See Also: BLIND
#
SOBRIETY

Usage : cast 'sobriety' <victim>
Group : Rejuvenation
Mana  : 40 - 50

Removes all affects of alcohol from the victim.
#
"SOUL LEECH"

Usage	: cast 'soul leech' <victim>

One of the darkest and feared magic abilities -- the power to steal life from
another. If successful, the caster will gain about a third of the victim's life
added to his own life total.
#
"SOUL TRAP"

Usage    : cast 'soul trap' <victim>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Psychic
Mana     : 500 - 700

If successful, the victim's soul will be drawn from its corpse and trapped
for use by the caster. The caster must be holding a soul gem prior to casting
the spell, and the gem must be of a high enough quality to hold the trapped
soul.

Note that this spell will only work on the creatures of the realm, and not
on your fellow players!

#
"SPELL STRENGTH" "STRENGTH SPELL"

Usage    : cast 'strength' <victim>
Duration : 2 Hours
Group    : Utility
Mana     : 200 - 300

The target of this spell will benefit from increased strength (the amount
dependant on the caster's level) for its duration.
#
STAFF STAVES

Usage : use <staff>

Staves come in two primary forms - one type is magickal and the other is as
a weapon.

Using a magickal staff will automatically target everybody (or everything)
in a room, except yourself.  Therefore staves are naturally very powerful,
and yet may be very dangerous to use around other players.

Staves capable of magic must be held prior to use, while those that can be
used as a weapon must be wielded.
#
STEALTH

The skills of this group represent the abilities commonly known to
thieves. They include:

Level 1: Pick Lock, Peek, Palm
Level 2: Shadow, Hide, Retreat
Level 3: Circle, Backstab, Subdue
Level 4: Sneak, Steal

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage daggers, as
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified).

See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
SYPHON "SYPHON ENERGY"

Usage : cast 'syphon energy' <corpse>
Group : Necromancy
Mana  : 200 - 300

This spell draws any remaining energy from a corpse and helps to restore
the caster's own life force.
#
VITALITY

Usage : cast 'vitality' <target>
Group : Rejuvenation
Mana  : 400 - 500

This spell restores the vital functions of the target, leaving them healthier 
and refreshed.
#
WAND WANDS

Wands cannot cast spells themselves, but must be wielded in order for you to
cast one. Each wand is subtly different, be it the material it was made from
or the benefit to you as a spell caster. Similarly, each spell has a mana
cost associated with it - these mana values vary depending on the type of wand
being wielded.

See Also: SPELLS
#
WATERBREATHE

Usage    : cast 'waterbreathe' <target>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Environmental
Mana     : 80 - 100

The target gains the ability to breathe underwater like a fish.  This magick does
not affect the targets ability to move underwater, however.
#
WATERWALK

Usage    : cast 'waterwalk' <target>
Duration : Varies with the caster's level
Group    : Environmental
Mana     : 80 - 100

Target gains the ability to walk on water. (and not just when it freezes!)
#
WILL

Usage: will '<mind-skill name>' [target]

For psionics.  If you want to use your mental abilities on someone or
something. (i.e Force your will)

Example:

  > will 'mind poke' warg
  Note that the name of the mind-skill must be enclosed by "'"s.

You can also find help on each individual mind-skill.

Examples:

  > help mind poke
  > help levitate
  > help dominate
#
WEAPONRY

The skills of this group represent an advanced ability when using weapons.
They include:

Level 1: Appraise, Compare
Level 2: Parry, Cutthroat
Level 3: Charge, Berserk
Level 4: Disembowel, Disarm

Learning this group will also allow you to wield higher damage weapons, as
indicated by any REQUIREMENT on them (which can be determined by having your
weapon identified). The exception to this will be staves, which can only be
wielded by those who study spell-casting groups.

See Also: REQUIREMENT IDENTIFY
#
"WORD OF INTELLECT"

Usage    : cast 'word of intellect'
Duration : 2 Hours
Group    : Utility
Mana     : 200 - 300

This short prayer, if answered, causes the victim to become smarter for a 
brief while. The amount of intelligence gain will be dependant on the caster's
level.
#
"WORD OF RECALL"

Usage : cast 'word of recall'
Group : Astral
Mana  : 40 - 70

The caster will be transferred back to his or her home-town sanctuary 
(Whatever city you started in.)  Word of Recall cannot be used during combat.
This applies to all forms of Word of Recall, whether it is a cast spell, 
scroll, etc.
#
ZEN

Usage	: cast 'zen' <self>

Instantly puts the caster into a meditative trance, used for focusing inner
strengths on healing. While meditating, the caster's wound heal somewhat, but
the caster is unable to move for a short time.
#
$
